. But the standard demanded of Klopp's team helps explain why his later complaints carried so much weight with supporters. An ordinary improvement was not enough. A very good season was not enough. Liverpool had produced an extraordinary league campaign and still needed more. That is the emotional heart of this story. Financial regulations can sound abstract. For supporters, the argument becomes a season, a final afternoon, and a trophy they never got to lift.", "voice_id": "bu5eKETbFKC8G702EAU4", "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2"}